WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:07.430
Part eight: reach out. Text everyone at a game, one stand, or just the stand leads, from your own phone.

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:15.193
Every roster has Reach out. Text everyone at this game opens a group text on your phone, to everyone working.

00:00:15.393 --> 00:00:18.039
Text the stand leads goes to the leads only.

00:00:18.239 --> 00:00:23.189
Copy all numbers puts the list on your clipboard, for a computer or Google Voice.

00:00:23.389 --> 00:00:32.797
Everyone in a group text sees each other's numbers. Over twenty people, it's split into groups of whole stands, because big group texts fail on many phones.

00:00:32.997 --> 00:00:37.350
Anyone without a phone on file is listed, so you can reach them another way.

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:41.120
Each stand has its own Text this stand button, too.

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:46.216
Your messages app opens a new group message, with everyone's numbers.

00:00:46.416 --> 00:00:56.280
It starts with a short intro: your first name, the game, and the date. Type the rest and send. It comes from your own phone, not the Hub, so it's not logged.

00:00:57.130 --> 00:00:59.605
On a computer, tap Copy all numbers,

00:00:59.805 --> 00:01:04.000
then paste them into Google Voice, or wherever you need them.
